OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrians injured after car
OL,4,A'mounts pavement' in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of pedestrians have been
OL,7,Finjured after they were struck by a car
OL,8,Fin the west end of Glasgow.
OL,10,FPolice Scotland said the incident
OL,11,Fhappened at about 15:45 on Hyndland
OL,12,FRoad.
OL,14,FA force spokesperson said: "Emergency
OL,15,Fservices are at the scene and drivers
OL,16,Fare urged to avoid the area."
OL,18,FUnconfirmed reports suggest the vehicle
OL,19,Fmay have mounted the pavement, hit a
OL,20,Fbus stop shelter and then struck
OL,21,Fscaffolding.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
